mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch9/dot-product.html"}